# 🕸️ KSP Sentinel AI — Phase 2: SOLID Architecture, Dynamic Multi-Store Ingestion & Network Intelligence

## 1. SOLID Compliance & Zero-Hardcoding Manifesto

Every component follows strict SOLID object-oriented & functional design principles with **zero hardcoded column names, fake edges, or fixed assumptions**:

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                 SOLID ARCHITECTURE BLUEPRINT                           │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  S — Single Responsibility (SRP)                                                       │
│      • SchemaProfiler: Only infers column types & relational semantic primitives.      │
│      • GraphTopologyBuilder: Only compiles entity vertices & co-occurrence edges.     │
│      • PhysicsSimulationEngine: Only manages Canvas 2D Euler vector forces.            │
│      • GraphQueryToolAgent: Only handles deterministic BFS/shortest-path traversal.   │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  O — Open/Closed (OCP)                                                                 │
│      • Extensible Extractor Registry (IEntityExtractor). Adding new entities (e.g.     │
│        Crypto Wallets, Drone IDs, Ballistics) requires registering a plugin extractor  │
│        without touching the core graph engine.                                         │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  L — Liskov Substitution (LSP)                                                         │
│      • Any dataset provider (CSV, Excel, SQL, NoSQL) implements IDatasetSource and      │
│        returns a standard NormalizedDataset interface seamlessly.                      │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  I — Interface Segregation (ISP)                                                       │
│      • INetworkVisualizer (UI rendering) is strictly separated from                    │
│        INetworkQueryEngine (algorithmic traversal). Chatbot only depends on Query API. │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  D — Dependency Inversion (DIP)                                                        │
│      • High-level controllers depend on abstract interfaces (IGraphStore, IToolAgent)  │
│        rather than concrete implementations.                                           │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

