## 2. The Composite Dual-Stream Ingestion Pipeline ("+" Feature Routing)

When a dataset is uploaded, it often contains **both statistical metrics** (amounts, dates, resolution days) and **relational entities** (suspect names, vehicle plates, phone numbers, station names).

The **`CompositeDatasetRouter`** automatically partitions and routes the incoming data:

