## 5. Chatbot `GraphQueryToolAgent` (Zero Hallucination Grounding)

**Target Files**: `src/components/Chatbot.jsx` & `src/analytics/services/networkAnalyticsService.js`

- **`get_graph_status()`**: Checks if relational data is locked in either the Primary Store or Dedicated Network Store.
- **`trace_shortest_path(entity_a, entity_b)`**: Runs $O(V + E)$ BFS pathfinding to find verified causal chains.
- **`get_entity_dossier(entity_id)`**: Retrieves all 1-hop & 2-hop connected associates, vehicles, and FIRs.
- **`find_syndicate_hubs(top_k)`**: Surfaces high-betweenness brokers and central coordinators.
- **Clean UI Execution**: All tool queries run in the background, returning structured Markdown findings in the chat feed with zero canvas disruption.

